  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Topic 1 covers sequences, series, logarithms, and (for AI SL) financial mathematics. The emphasis is on recognising patterns, applying formulae, and choosing between arithmetic and geometric models.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Arithmetic sequences &amp; series",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[u_n=u_1+(n-1)d,\\quad S_n=\\frac{n}{2}(u_1+u_n)=\\frac{n}{2}[2u_1+(n-1)d].\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Geometric sequences &amp; series",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[u_n=u_1\\,r^{n-1},\\quad S_n=\\frac{u_1(r^n-1)}{r-1}\\;(r\\neq1),\\quad S_\\infty=\\frac{u_1}{1-r}\\;(|r|<1).\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Laws of exponents &amp; logarithms",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[a^m\\cdot a^n=a^{m+n},\\quad\\frac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n},\\quad(a^m)^n=a^{mn},\\quad a^0=1.\\]\\[\\log_a(xy)=\\log_a x+\\log_a y,\\quad\\log_a(x/y)=\\log_a x-\\log_a y,\\quad\\log_a(x^n)=n\\log_a x.\\]\\[\\log_b a=\\frac{\\ln a}{\\ln b}\\quad(\\text{change of base}).\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Binomial theorem (AA SL)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[(a+b)^n=\\sum_{r=0}^{n}\\binom{n}{r}a^{n-r}b^r,\\quad\\binom{n}{r}=\\frac{n!}{r!(n-r)!}.\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "def",
        "label": {
          "en": "● Financial mathematics (AI SL)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\[\\text{Compound interest: }FV=PV\\!\\left(1+\\frac{r}{100k}\\right)^{kn}.\\]<p>Use GDC TVM solver: \\(N\\) = total periods, \\(I\\%\\), \\(PV\\), \\(PMT\\), \\(FV\\), \\(P/Y=C/Y\\).</p>\\[\\text{Inflation-adjusted real rate: }\\approx r_{\\text{nominal}}-r_{\\text{inflation}}.\\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1.1",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "The 5th term of a geometric sequence is 48 and the 8th term is 384. Find \\(u_1\\) and \\(r.\\)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\(u_5=u_1r^4=48,\\quad u_8=u_1r^7=384.\\)</p><p>Divide: \\(r^3=384/48=8\\Rightarrow r=2.\\quad u_1=48/2^4=48/16=3.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1.2 — Binomial term",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Find the coefficient of \\(x^4\\) in \\((2x-3)^6.\\)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>Term: \\(\\binom{6}{2}(2x)^4(-3)^2=15\\cdot16x^4\\cdot9=2160\\,x^4.\\) Coefficient: <strong>2160.</strong></p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1.3 — Logarithm equation",
          "ar": null
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Solve \\(\\log_3(x+2)+\\log_3(x-4)=3.\\)",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\(\\log_3[(x+2)(x-4)]=3\\Rightarrow(x+2)(x-4)=27.\\)</p><p>\\(x^2-2x-8=27\\Rightarrow x^2-2x-35=0\\Rightarrow(x-7)(x+5)=0.\\)</p><p>Reject \\(x=-5\\) (gives \\(\\log_3(-3)\\) undefined). Answer: \\(x=7.\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>An arithmetic sequence has first term \\(a\\) and common difference \\(d\\). The 6th term is 17 and the sum of the first 8 terms is 88. Find \\(a\\) and \\(d\\).</p><details style=\"margin-top:8px\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;font-weight:600\">Show solution</summary><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><p>\\(u_6=a+5d=17\\) &nbsp;(1)</p><p>\\(S_8=\\frac{8}{2}(2a+7d)=88\\Rightarrow 2a+7d=22\\) &nbsp;(2)</p><p>From (1): \\(a=17-5d.\\) Sub into (2): \\(2(17-5d)+7d=22\\Rightarrow 34-3d=22\\Rightarrow d=4.\\)</p><p>\\(a=17-20=-3.\\) &nbsp;<strong>Answer: \\(a=-3,\\;d=4.\\)</strong></p></div></details>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example-grid",
        "label": {
          "en": "Geometric sequence",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the 8th term and sum of the first 8 terms of the sequence 3, 6, 12, …</p><p><strong>Solution:</strong> \\(u_1=3,\\; r=2\\)</p><p>\\(u_8 = 3 \\cdot 2^{7} = 384\\)</p><p>\\(S_8 = \\dfrac{3(2^8-1)}{2-1} = 3\\times 255 = 765\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example-grid",
        "label": {
          "en": "Change of base",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Evaluate \\(\\log_4 128\\).</p><p><strong>Solution:</strong> \\(\\log_4 128 = \\dfrac{\\ln 128}{\\ln 4} = \\dfrac{7\\ln 2}{2\\ln 2} = \\dfrac{7}{2} = 3.5\\)</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "<strong>Practice:</strong> An arithmetic sequence has \\(u_1 = 5\\) and \\(u_{10} = 32\\). Find the common difference and \\(S_{20}\\).",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "\\(d = \\frac{32-5}{9} = 3\\).  \\(S_{20} = \\frac{20}{2}[2(5)+19(3)] = 10 \\times 67 = 670\\)",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
